<h1 style='color: #111827; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.3; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
    Verify your email
</h1>

<p style='color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
    Hi {{name}},
</p>

<p style='color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
    We received a request to resend your verification link. Please confirm your email address by clicking the button
    below.
</p>

{{> button link=link buttonText="Verify my email"}}

{{> divider}}

<p style='color: #9ca3af; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;'>
    If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
